259
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:31,660
Ah, man.

260
00:16:32,380 --> 00:16:34,457
I should have thought through that one.

261
00:16:34,540 --> 00:16:36,246
I made a real mess of things.

262
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:38,737
I don't even know where
all the pieces went.

263
00:16:38,820 --> 00:16:40,879
I hope I didn't harm any civilians.

264
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:44,740
Warn us before you drop a
meteor next time. It's scary.

265
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:47,960
I brought down a meteor. Real sorry.

266
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:49,260
Too late!

267
00:16:56,540 --> 00:17:00,540
You realize this could get terribly ugly.

268
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:04,713
I'm still getting used to my new powers.

269
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:07,720
I'm lucky I was able to ward that off.

270
00:17:11,560 --> 00:17:12,540
Vice Admiral!

271
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:14,840
Are you all right, sir?

272
00:17:16,220 --> 00:17:18,380
No, no, I said so!

273
00:17:20,140 --> 00:17:22,840
You really have caused quite the mess.

274
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:25,316
You mentioned your duty as a brother.

275
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:26,830
Yeah?

276
00:17:27,140 --> 00:17:30,400
I can't help but be
reminded of Firefist Ace.

277
00:17:30,740 --> 00:17:34,460
When he possessed your same power
before he died at Marineford,

278
00:17:34,780 --> 00:17:38,662
he said that Straw Hat Luffy was
his brother, though not by blood.

279
00:17:42,340 --> 00:17:45,160
So are you also his brother?

280
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:53,360
All it takes to become brothers
is to share some sake. Brothers!

281
00:17:55,820 --> 00:17:58,620
The three of us exchanged a cup of sake.

282
00:18:00,520 --> 00:18:04,600
Even in death, our bond will never break.

283
00:18:19,660 --> 00:18:23,960
I must say that's a rather troublesome
little family you've got there.

284
00:18:24,460 --> 00:18:25,840
One of them is enough!

285
00:18:26,260 --> 00:18:28,380
An upstart with a massive bounty!

286
00:18:29,500 --> 00:18:32,500
A former commander of
the Whitebeard Pirates!

287
00:18:33,600 --> 00:18:36,620
And the Chief of Staff from
the Revolutionary Army!

288
00:18:38,920 --> 00:18:40,320
Mark my words.

289
00:18:40,740 --> 00:18:44,480
No matter where I am, no
matter what I'm doing,

290
00:18:45,140 --> 00:18:47,260
even if I must abandon my duties,

291
00:18:48,380 --> 00:18:52,020
The moment that Luffy needs
my help, I'll be there.

292
00:18:57,320 --> 00:18:59,080
I won't let him down.

293
00:19:07,120 --> 00:19:08,540
Sabo! Sabo!

294
00:19:14,060 --> 00:19:15,120
Never again.

295
00:19:23,040 --> 00:19:25,520
I think I've asked enough questions.

296
00:19:25,940 --> 00:19:27,040
Hardly any point.

297
00:19:28,600 --> 00:19:29,430
Sorry.

298
00:19:29,600 --> 00:19:30,940
Was I boring you?

299
00:19:31,220 --> 00:19:35,220
I like a story better when I
can enjoy it with a cup of sake.

300
00:19:39,900 --> 00:19:40,730
Luffy.

301
00:19:46,420 --> 00:19:47,720
Luffy, I swear!

302
00:19:48,480 --> 00:19:49,960
I'll protect you!

303
00:20:05,320 --> 00:20:06,880
Go, go, go, go!

304
00:20:11,940 --> 00:20:16,297
That's the Colosseum's Grim Reaper, but
why does it have Straw Hat on its back?

305
00:20:16,380 --> 00:20:19,417
As long as we keep him away
from the palace, we're good!

306
00:20:19,500 --> 00:20:21,324
He'll lose the game eventually!

307
00:20:24,400 --> 00:20:26,320
You leave Moosey alone!

308
00:20:37,460 --> 00:20:38,820
Alright, Moosey!

309
00:20:40,560 --> 00:20:42,920
Grim Reaper, coming through!

310
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:44,777
Get out of the way!

311
00:20:44,860 --> 00:20:46,020
Can't you see?

312
00:20:46,380 --> 00:20:47,520
We're in a hurry!

313
00:20:56,980 --> 00:20:57,810
Cabbage!

314
00:21:04,940 --> 00:21:07,800
Pardon me, but I'll be taking the lead.

315
00:21:12,780 --> 00:21:13,610
Dammit!

316
00:21:13,693 --> 00:21:15,417
I thought I was taking
a shortcut for sure!

317
00:21:15,500 --> 00:21:17,940
We gotta pick up the pace, Moosey, okay?

318
00:21:21,340 --> 00:21:22,170
Crap!

319
00:21:22,253 --> 00:21:24,021
Now everyone's catching up to us!

320
00:21:24,840 --> 00:21:25,840
It's I-Rudan!

321
00:21:29,520 --> 00:21:30,400
Move it!

322
00:21:30,540 --> 00:21:32,657
I don't have time to play with you chumps!

323
00:21:32,740 --> 00:21:34,269
I've got some place to be!

324
00:21:36,540 --> 00:21:38,620
This sucks! We're losing!

325
00:21:39,100 --> 00:21:40,260
Here he comes!

326
00:21:40,700 --> 00:21:41,740
Not again!

327
00:21:43,060 --> 00:21:43,890
Don't blink!

328
00:21:44,020 --> 00:21:44,902
Shoot the ball!

329
00:21:50,380 --> 00:21:52,640
Hey, you bunch of crab bags.

330
00:21:52,900 --> 00:21:55,877
Keep your paws off Straw Hat, or else...

331
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:03,880
Who's that?

332
00:22:06,540 --> 00:22:08,440
You're breaking my heart, kid.

333
00:22:08,720 --> 00:22:10,420
Come on, I'm from Block C.

334
00:22:10,720 --> 00:22:12,660
The same round as you, remember?

335
00:22:12,960 --> 00:22:14,300
It's Kelly Funk!

336
00:22:16,380 --> 00:22:17,380
You sure?

337
00:22:19,180 --> 00:22:22,620
Your buddy god, Usopp,
really saved my tail today.

338
00:22:22,900 --> 00:22:24,340
Just being friendly!

339
00:22:25,180 --> 00:22:27,720
Anyway, I found a shortcut you can use.

340
00:22:27,960 --> 00:22:32,489
It'll take you straight to the sunflower
field, right in front of the palace.

341
00:22:33,180 --> 00:22:34,010
Seriously?

342
00:22:34,093 --> 00:22:35,668
This is the least I can do.

343
00:22:35,820 --> 00:22:39,180
Alright, let's leave cabbage in the dust!

344
00:22:41,920 --> 00:22:43,320
Hey, Straw Hat.

345
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:46,997
I still gotta get these handcuffs off.

346
00:22:47,080 --> 00:22:50,374
There's no point in reaching
the palace if I can't fight

347
00:22:50,780 --> 00:22:51,637
at this rate.

348
00:22:51,720 --> 00:22:53,277
Doflamingo will just kill me.

349
00:22:53,360 --> 00:22:56,757
Work out, at least I think so.

350
00:22:56,840 --> 00:22:58,037
What if you're wrong?

351
00:22:58,120 --> 00:23:00,237
We need to go back to that plateau.

352
00:23:00,320 --> 00:23:02,937
Why to find the key?

353
00:23:03,020 --> 00:23:05,357
If we don't win this
fight, them we're all dead.

354
00:23:05,440 --> 00:23:07,840
See that? Shortcut. Told ya.

355
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:12,380
What are you waiting for? Go ahead.

356
00:23:12,720 --> 00:23:16,660
I'll stay here and keep watch
for you. Thanks. Sounds awesome.

357
00:23:16,960 --> 00:23:18,220
Moosey, let's go.

358
00:23:21,760 --> 00:23:22,880
Best of luck.

359
00:23:23,740 --> 00:23:25,505
Thanks for the tip, my friend.

360
00:23:25,700 --> 00:23:28,097
And thanks for guarding the entrance, too.

361
00:23:28,180 --> 00:23:29,520
Will do you proud.

362
00:23:36,400 --> 00:23:40,320
Oh well, we didn't need them, did we?

363
00:23:40,880 --> 00:23:43,840
Nope, no looking back! Let's go!

364
00:23:45,320 --> 00:23:47,620
To the sunflower field!

365
00:23:52,160 --> 00:23:54,420
We'll be all right.

366
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:56,820
You just keep going.

367
00:24:01,780 --> 00:24:03,980
That's your snail, isn't it? Get it.

368
00:24:05,100 --> 00:24:05,930
Hello?

369
00:24:06,013 --> 00:24:09,317
This is Luffy, the man who's
gonna be king of the pirates.

370
00:24:09,400 --> 00:24:10,700
Hi, Luffy. It's me.

371
00:24:11,260 --> 00:24:12,090
Robin!

372
00:24:12,260 --> 00:24:15,640
Right now, we're at the plateau.
Same as before. And you?

373
00:24:17,700 --> 00:24:22,288
We're at the bottom of that other plateau,
on the way to some sunflower field.

374
00:24:22,680 --> 00:24:23,957
That's four levels up.

375
00:24:24,040 --> 00:24:24,870
Nice progress.

376
00:24:24,953 --> 00:24:25,980
Good news.

377
00:24:26,340 --> 00:24:28,157
Viola found the key to the cuffs.

378
00:24:28,240 --> 00:24:29,070
Let's meet up.

379
00:24:29,180 --> 00:24:31,520
Oh, awesome! Great. Let's hurry.

380
00:24:31,880 --> 00:24:32,998
Where should we go?

381
00:24:33,360 --> 00:24:35,920
This is Leo, from the Tantana tribe.

382
00:24:36,680 --> 00:24:39,780
Real soon, Miss Rebecca,
the big rooster guy.

383
00:24:40,080 --> 00:24:42,757
And Robiland will be escorted
to your nearest location.

384
00:24:42,840 --> 00:24:44,160
at super high speed.

385
00:24:45,300 --> 00:24:49,120
Luffy, we'll meet at the
sunflower field. That's perfect.

386
00:24:49,660 --> 00:24:52,700
Uh, but how are you guys
gonna catch up with us?

387
00:24:52,920 --> 00:24:53,957
I'll explain later.

388
00:24:54,040 --> 00:24:57,300
You just worry about
getting there. Peleck.

389
00:24:58,520 --> 00:24:59,350
See?

390
00:24:59,433 --> 00:25:00,540
It all worked out.

391
00:25:00,840 --> 00:25:02,075
Yeah, by coincidence.

392
00:25:02,560 --> 00:25:05,440
We're off to the sunflower field, Moosey.

393
00:25:09,700 --> 00:25:10,700
Turn back.

394
00:25:10,880 --> 00:25:12,174
This place is flooded.

395
00:25:16,760 --> 00:25:19,120
It's a dead end. Get out. Hurry.

396
00:25:20,100 --> 00:25:21,700
Don't panic, Moosey.

397
00:25:25,360 --> 00:25:26,600
Someone's coming!

398
00:25:52,320 --> 00:25:53,620
It's you!

399
00:25:54,040 --> 00:25:56,320
Doflamingo!
